 ## Troubleshooting
 
 | Symptom | Cause | Fix |
 |---------|-------|-----|
-| 302 loop on Stripe/OAuth redirect | `redirect_to` for external URL | Use `inertia_location` — it returns 409 + `X-Inertia-Location` header |
-| Errors don't display next to fields | Error keys don't match input `name` | `to_hash` keys must match input `name` attributes exactly |
-| TS2305: `postsPath` not found in `@/routes` | js-routes not regenerated after adding routes | Run `rails js_routes:generate` after changing `config/routes.rb` |
+| 302 loop on Stripe/OAuth redirect | `redirect` for external URL | Use `location` — it returns 409 + `X-Inertia-Location` header |
+| Errors don't display next to fields | Error keys don't match input `name` | Form error keys must match input `name` attributes exactly |
+| Frontend route mismatch | URL differs from urls.py | Update callers and route smoke tests together; no route generator is installed |
 
